(1\) To ensure the final ACK sent by the client arrives safely at the server; if the final ACK is lost, the server will retransmit its) Tj
T* (FIN, which the client can only re-acknowledge if it remains in TIME_WAIT.) Tj
T* (2\) To allow all old duplicate segments from the connection to dissipate completely in the network, preventing them from being) Tj
T* (misinterpreted by a future connection utilizing the same port pair.) Tj
